1
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:14,770
My moped roars against the hill,
The autumn air is damp and chill.

2
00:00:15,022 --> 00:00:19,908
Black cypresses against the sky,
A graveyard where the shadows lie.

3
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:24,893
You know how this goes,
A cold, slimy hand on my throat.

4
00:00:25,064 --> 00:00:30,646
Come back to the dark, it is safer in here,
It is better to be alone than to break.

5
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:39,873
The church is dark, I step inside,
A slimy shadow starts to slide.

6
00:00:40,077 --> 00:00:44,871
Like blackest oil through broken skin,
The cold, familiar hand walks in.

7
00:00:44,944 --> 00:00:49,596
You know how this goes,
A cold, slimy hand on my throat.

8
00:00:50,047 --> 00:00:55,692
Come back to the dark, it is safer in here,
It is better to be alone than to break.

9
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:04,961
White linen spread on heavy wood,
Sweet cherry pie where laughter stood.

10
00:01:05,232 --> 00:01:09,938
They toast to Opa, warm and bright,
I am a shadow in their light.

11
00:01:10,067 --> 00:01:14,571
You know how this goes,
A cold, slimy hand on my throat.

12
00:01:15,072 --> 00:01:20,672
Come back to the dark, it is safer in here,
It is better to be alone than to break.

13
00:01:25,251 --> 00:01:30,015
An aunt looks up and calls me new,
My frozen heart is split in two.

14
00:01:30,223 --> 00:01:34,849
Am I a temporary phase,
To disappear in passing days?

15
00:01:34,948 --> 00:01:39,579
You know how this goes,
A cold, slimy hand on my throat.

16
00:01:40,046 --> 00:01:45,525
Come back to the dark, it is safer in here,
It is better to be alone than to break.

17
00:01:50,208 --> 00:01:54,967
The demon whispers in my chest:
You will break her heart, just like the rest.

18
00:01:55,247 --> 00:01:59,875
You do not belong, you are too weak,
Run back to where the night is bleak.

19
00:02:00,047 --> 00:02:04,557
You know how this goes,
A cold, slimy hand on my throat.

20
00:02:05,052 --> 00:02:10,688
Come back to the dark, it is safer in here,
It is better to be alone than to break.

21
00:02:15,061 --> 00:02:20,024
My inner lion roars in pain,
But anger drains my burning brain.

22
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:24,955
My tired head falls on her side,
With tears I can no longer hide.

23
00:02:25,052 --> 00:02:29,553
You know how this goes,
A cold, slimy hand on my throat.

24
00:02:30,027 --> 00:02:35,677
Come back to the dark, it is safer in here,
It is better to be alone than to break.

25
00:02:40,193 --> 00:02:44,910
But under cloth, Luna squeezes tight,
A silent anchor in the night.

26
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:49,972
I am still here, I choose your pain,
As outside falls the heavy rain.

27
00:02:50,005 --> 00:02:54,909
Outside, the heavy rain falls fast,
But under the cloth, we hold at last.

28
00:02:55,033 --> 00:03:00,707
Not perfect, and not free of pain,
But together, we remain.

29
00:03:14,786 --> 00:03:15,953
Then to break

